  VALUES ('rust', 'en', 'junior', 'What is the difference between `&str` and `String`?', 'String literals have type `&''static str`. `String::from("hello")` heap-allocates. Function parameters should accept `&str` when read-only access suffices — it accepts both literals and `&String` (via deref coercion). `.to_string()` or `.to_owned()` converts `&str` to `String`.', 1, true)
