  VALUES ('rust', 'en', 'junior', 'What does Cargo do and what is its role in the Rust ecosystem?', '`cargo new`, `cargo build --release`, `cargo test`, `cargo doc`, `cargo publish`. `Cargo.toml` declares metadata and dependencies; `Cargo.lock` pins exact versions for reproducible builds. `cargo clippy` lints; `cargo fmt` formats. The Cargo ecosystem makes Rust''s toolchain the most approachable of any systems language.', 1, true)
